ex:C045R0007Condition53 a ct:Condition ;
    ct:description "6.3.1 You will commence the Hotel Work on or before the Construction Commencement Date or Renovation Commencement Date specified in the Addendum. You may request an extension by submitting a written request for our approval before the applicable deadline, describing the status of the project and the reason for the requested extension, and paying our then-current extension fee. We may condition our approval on an update to the Plans and Designs. Once commenced, the Hotel Work will continue uninterrupted except to the extent continuation is prevented by events of Force Majeure. You must give written notice to us specifying the nature and duration of any event of Force Majeure promptly after becoming aware of the event, and specifying that you have used, and continue to use, reasonable endeavours to mitigate the effects of such event until such event ceases to exist. On verification of the event of Force Majeure, we will approve an extension of the Construction Commencement Date or Renovation Work Completion Date for up to eighteen (18) months. You must promptly provide to us evidence that the Construction Work has commenced if we request it.   " ;
